{
	"name": "Unyielding Grip",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/control/debuff-energy-hold-levitate-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When a grappled character would be pushed or pulled out of your threatened area, you can make a Strength save against the spell save or combat maneuver DC of the creature attempting to move your grappled target to keep them from getting moved. On a failure, you are instead moved with them and the grapple continues. Once you have activated this maneuver you are able to maintain it as a stance, making additional saves or getting moved with the target until they escape the grapple.</p>",
